translate english c28s004_ScaGetsJob_32d4061f:

    # sca "El lunes. Mañana por la tarde tengo que ir a la oficina en San Luis para firmar el contrato y que me den los uniformes."
    sca "On Monday. Tomorrow afternoon I have to go to the office in San Luis to sign the contract and get my uniforms."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:1829
translate english c28s004_ScaGetsJob_9374759b:

    # mc "Si quieres puedo llevarte, aún no tengo nada importante que hacer mañana por la tarde."
    mc "If you want, I can give you a ride. I don't have anything important to do tomorrow afternoon."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:1831
translate english c28s004_ScaGetsJob_31578f57:

    # sca "No hace falta, pero gracias. Se lo he pedido a Tía [nor]."
    sca "No need, but thank you. I've asked Aunt [nor]."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:1832
translate english c28s004_ScaGetsJob_9dfc02e1:

    # mc "*Risa* ¿Vais a ir con su coche? Te arriesgas a no llegar."
    mc "*Laugh* Are you going to go in her car? You risk not getting there."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:1834
translate english c28s004_ScaGetsJob_23b2609a:

    # dap "Yo le he dicho lo mismo. *Risa* Me ha dicho que le pedirá el coche a Tía [mar] para asegurarse de que no pasa nada."
    dap "I told her the same thing. *Laugh* She said she would ask Aunt [mar] for the car to make sure nothing is wrong."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:1836
translate english c28s004_ScaGetsJob_3db8cd02:

    # mom "Ningún problema, puede cogerlo cuando quiera."
    mom "No problem, she can drive it whenever she wants."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:1837
translate english c28s004_ScaGetsJob_031d5334:

    # mc "*Risa* Sólo falta que no te dejes las luces encendidas y te quedes sin batería."
    mc "*Laugh* Just make sure you don't leave the lights on and run out of battery."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:1839
translate english c28s004_ScaGetsJob_7e43a856:

    # mom "Si pasa eso, [nor] tendrá que coger tu camioneta. *Risa* Seguro que no te ríes tanto entonces."
    mom "If that happens, [nor] will have to borrow your pick-up truck. *Laugh* I bet you won't be laughing so much then."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:1840
translate english c28s004_ScaGetsJob_cedf5288:

    # mc "¡Nooo! *Risa* Tengo que ir a comprobar si tu coche tiene batería."
    mc "Nooo! *Laugh* Now, I have to go check if your car has enough battery."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:1842
translate english c28s004_ScaGetsJob_b3f3e279:

    # sca "Ahora estoy nerviosa por si tendrán uniformes de mi talla... O si me quedará bien."
    sca "Now I'm nervous about whether they'll have uniforms in my size... Or whether they'll fit me."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:1843
translate english c28s004_ScaGetsJob_55bd3e9d:

    # mc "Si te hacen ir a las oficinas, seguro que tienen uniformes de diversas tallas. No tienes por qué preocuparte."
    mc "If they are making you go to the offices, I'm sure they'll have uniforms in various sizes. You don't have to worry."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:1846
translate english c28s004_ScaGetsJob_7bf04f59:

    # dap "Y seguro que le queda bien. A las chicas delgadas y con tetas pequeñas como ella toda la ropa les queda bien."
    dap "And I'm sure it will look good on her. Skinny girls with small breasts like her look good in everything."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:1848
translate english c28s004_ScaGetsJob_9587da4a:

    # dap "¿Has hecho donuts, Tía [mar]? ¿Puedo coger uno?"
    dap "Did you make doughnuts, Aunt [mar]? Can I have one?"

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:1851
translate english c28s004_ScaGetsJob_4b47a0bd:

