translate english c28s004_ScaGetsJob_dc53d40d:

    # dap "Nos estábamos probando ropa cuando Scarlett ha recibido la llamada."
    dap "We were trying on clothes when [sca] got the call."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:1900
translate english c28s004_ScaGetsJob_cc1dd83f:

    # sca "Queríamos hacer unas fotos de cosplay para subirlas a InstaPic."
    sca "We wanted to take some cosplay photos to upload to InstaPic."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:1903
translate english c28s004_ScaGetsJob_df0910b6:

    # "Después de eso, pasáis un rato charlando de la propuesta de matrimonio y del trabajo de [sca]."
    "After that, you spend some time chatting about the marriage proposal and [sca]'s work."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:1905
translate english c28s004_ScaGetsJob_018726bd:

    # "Obviamente, lo que fuera a escapársele a [sca] no vuelve a hacer su aparición en la conversación."
    "Obviously, whatever [sca] was about to let slip does not reappear in the conversation."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:1907
translate english c28s004_ScaGetsJob_5dc0265d:

    # "Pasáis un rato charlando del trabajo de [sca], intentando sin éxito quitarle los nervios."
    "You spend some time chatting about [sca]'s work, trying unsuccessfully to calm her nerves."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:1908
translate english c28s004_ScaGetsJob_9327230f:

    # "Al cabo de un rato las chicas deciden seguir visitando a todo el mundo para dar la noticia. Hay una nueva camarera en la familia."
    "After a while, the girls decide to continue visiting everyone to share the news. There is a new waitress in the family."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:1910
translate english c28s004_ScaGetsJob_3431064b:

    # "Tú vuelves a tu habitación. Estás seguro de que Aaron te habrá mandado dos o tres correos a estas horas."
    "You go back to your room. You're sure Aaron will have sent you two or three emails by now."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:1914
translate english c28s004_DebKiaraTalk_7d80596c:

    # kia "Ahora te busco ese libro. Me extraña que no tengan las memorias de Dana Torres en la universidad."
    kia "I'll look for that book for you. I'm surprised they don't have Dana Torres' memoirs at the university."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:1915
translate english c28s004_DebKiaraTalk_5914091b:

    # deb "No es que no lo tengan. Es que solo tienen un ejemplar y alguien lo ha cogido justo hoy."
    deb "It's not that they don't have it. It's just that they only have one copy, and someone has borrowed it just today."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:1916
translate english c28s004_DebKiaraTalk_985b03a9:

    # deb "Tengo ganas de leerlo y no quiero esperar a que lo devuelvan."
    deb "I want to read it and I don't want to wait for them to return it."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:1918
translate english c28s004_DebKiaraTalk_cfb21edb:

    # kia "¿Por eso has pensado en mí?"
    kia "Is that why you thought of me?"

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:1919
translate english c28s004_DebKiaraTalk_ce20af47:

    # kia "*Risa* Solo me quieres por mis libros..."
    kia "*Laugh* You only love me for my books..."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:1921
translate english c28s004_DebKiaraTalk_f99561bb:

    # deb "*Risa* Sabes que no es verdad. Te quiero por muchas más cosas. Pero adoro tus libros y que nos podamos sentar en la piscina a hablar de ellos."
    deb "*Laugh* You know that's not true. I love you for many other reasons. But I adore your books and that we can sit by the pool and talk about them."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:1922
translate english c28s004_DebKiaraTalk_d974cf2b:

    # deb "No hay mucha gente en casa con quien hablar de algunos libros."
    deb "There aren't many people at home to talk to about certain books."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:1924
translate english c28s004_DebKiaraTalk_9dfce8ea:

    # kia "Tienes razón. No hay muchos fans de Jane Austen en casa."
    kia "You're right. There aren't many Jane Austen fans at home."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:1925
translate english c28s004_DebKiaraTalk_a70f3e8e:

    # kia "¿Quieres llevarte algún libro más?"
    kia "Would you like any other books?"

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:1927
translate english c28s004_DebKiaraTalk_dd8e9a89:

    # deb "Sí. Mira a ver si tenéis '¿Por qué Tía [kia] no nos ha dicho que ayer fue su cumpleaños?'"
    deb "Yes. See if you have a copy of 'Why didn't Aunt [kia] tell us that yesterday was her birthday?'"

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:1928
translate english c28s004_DebKiaraTalk_30c9a8e8:

    # deb "Dicen que es un clásico sobre la gente que cree que no tiene nada que celebrar."
    deb "They say it's a classic about people who think they have nothing to celebrate."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:1930
translate english c28s004_DebKiaraTalk_f184a36d:

    # kia "¿Me vas a echar la bronca por no celebrar mi cumpleaños?"
    kia "Are you going to scold me for not celebrating my birthday?"

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:1932
translate english c28s004_DebKiaraTalk_e58d1bf5:

    # deb "Esa era una de mis ideas cuando venía hacia aquí. [eil] nos lo ha dicho esta mañana."
    deb "That was one of my ideas when I was on my way here. [eil] told us this morning."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:1933
translate english c28s004_DebKiaraTalk_b0572988:

    # deb "Primero le hemos echado la bronca a ella por no decírnoslo antes para prepararte una fiesta sorpresa."
    deb "First, we scolded her for not telling us earlier so we could prepare a surprise party for you."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:1935
translate english c28s004_DebKiaraTalk_9f0693f3:

    # kia "No me gustan las fiestas sorpresa, y no me gusta celebrar mi cumpleaños."
    kia "I don't like surprise parties, and I don't like celebrating my birthday."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:1936
translate english c28s004_DebKiaraTalk_cf466563:

    # kia "Con lo que es mejor que [eil] os lo haya dicho cuando ya ha pasado. De todas formas le echaré bronca por decíroslo."
    kia "So, it's better that [eil] told you after it happened. Anyway, I'll give her an earful for telling you."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:1938
translate english c28s004_DebKiaraTalk_442ec956:

    # deb "Se le ha escapado. Estábamos tomando el sol y [sca] ha venido preguntando las fechas de nacimiento."
    deb "She slipped up. We were sunbathing and [sca] came over asking for our birthdates."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:1939
translate english c28s004_DebKiaraTalk_4c09976b:

    # deb "Quiere hacer algo con una app para que no se nos olvide nunca felicitarnos entre nosotras."
    deb "She wants to do something with an app so that we never forget to buy gifts for each other."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:1940
translate english c28s004_DebKiaraTalk_411d97f9:

    # deb "[eil] ha dicho su fecha de nacimiento y la tuya. Todas hemos flipado cuando nos hemos dado cuenta de que tu cumpleaños fue ayer."
    deb "[eil] said your birthdate and hers. We were all shocked when we realized that your birthday was yesterday."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:1942
translate english c28s004_DebKiaraTalk_1adbd33d:

    # kia "¿[eil] no os ha dicho por qué no lo celebro?"
    kia "Hasn't [eil] told you why I don't want to celebrate it?"

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:1944
translate english c28s004_DebKiaraTalk_3602b04a:

    # deb "Nos ha dicho que no te gusta hacerlo pero no nos ha querido contar por qué."
    deb "She told us that you don't like doing it, but she didn't want to tell us why."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:1946
translate english c28s004_DebKiaraTalk_58e825de:

    # kia "Mis cumpleaños dejaron de ser importantes cuando nació ella. No porque naciera ella, claro."
    kia "My birthdays ceased to be important when she was born. Not because she was born, of course."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:1947
translate english c28s004_DebKiaraTalk_4d5b1087:

    # kia "Pero es cuando todo se empezó a ir a la mierda con Solomon."
    kia "But that's when everything started to go to hell with Solomon."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:1949
translate english c28s004_DebKiaraTalk_5dd4bae7:

    # kia "Cada vez tenía menos ganas de celebrar nada que no tuviera que ver directamente con [eil]."
    kia "I felt less and less like celebrating anything that wasn't directly related to [eil]."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:1950
translate english c28s004_DebKiaraTalk_4f89a79a:

    # kia "Ella no tenía que pagar las consecuencias de un matrimonio infeliz."
    kia "She didn't have to pay the consequences of an unhappy marriage."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:1952
translate english c28s004_DebKiaraTalk_df9c82cd:

    # kia "Y celebrar mi cumpleaños era un recordatorio de que... no sé..."
    kia "And celebrating my birthday was a reminder of... I don't know..."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:1953
translate english c28s004_DebKiaraTalk_afea7ea1:

    # kia "Cuando Solomon empezó a olvidarlos casi me alegré. Se convirtió en una costumbre no celebrarlos. Porque no había nada que celebrar."
    kia "When Solomon started forgetting them, I was almost glad. It became a habit not to celebrate them. Because there was nothing to celebrate."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:1955
translate english c28s004_DebKiaraTalk_54288c34:

    # deb "Pero ahora Solomon no está, con lo que sería un buen momento para volver a celebrarlos."
    deb "But now Solomon is gone, so it would be a good time to celebrate them again."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:1956
translate english c28s004_DebKiaraTalk_925d495a:

    # deb "No te vas a librar. Recuerda lo bien que estuvo la fiesta de las chicas."
    deb "You're not getting away with it. Remember how much fun the girls' party was."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:1958
translate english c28s004_DebKiaraTalk_096eee75:

    # kia "*Risa* Ellas cumplían 19. ¡Yo cumpliré 48 en mi próximo cumpleaños!"
    kia "*Laugh* They were turning 19. I'll be turning 48 on my next birthday!"

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:1959
translate english c28s004_DebKiaraTalk_96c2dd60:

