# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:2518
translate english c28s005_GavCall_a51a8fd4:

    # "Incluso sabiendo que esa parte de la empresa va a desaparecer."
    "Even knowing that part of the company is going to disappear."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:2519
translate english c28s005_GavCall_6e102ecf:

    # "Ahora mismo, la empresa está en un impasse. Se mantiene por inercia y por los temas que ya estaban en marcha antes de la Guerra Clon."
    "Right now, the company is at an impasse. It is being kept going by inertia and by issues that were already underway before the Clone War."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:2520
translate english c28s005_GavCall_5cf4beb5:

    # "Pero nadie se atreve a dar un paso adelante en ninguna dirección."
