    aar "There's someone who wants to talk to you. I think you should listen to him."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:2528
translate english c28s005_GavCall_39a644d6:

    # mc "¿Quién?"
    mc "Who?"

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:2530
translate english c28s005_GavCall_129d3ac7:

    # aar "Gavin. Hoy los médicos le han dejado salir de la base por primera vez y hemos estado hablando."
    aar "Gavin. Today the doctors let him leave the base for the first time, and we've been talking."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:2531
translate english c28s005_GavCall_377bd95e:

    # aar "Bueno, llevamos varios días hablando. No lo conocía demasiado, pero es buen chico."
    aar "Well, we've been talking for several days. I didn't know him very well, but he's a good guy."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:2532
translate english c28s005_GavCall_ce6225f6:

    # mc "¿Cuándo habéis estado paseando por la playa?"
    mc "It was when you were walking on the beach?"

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:2535
translate english c28s005_GavCall_e6e985b6:

    # aar "¿Tienes a gente espiándome? ¿No te fías de mí?"
    aar "Are you having people spy on me? Don't you trust me?"

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:2536
translate english c28s005_GavCall_23c40331:

    # mc "No, Aaron. No es mi estilo. Alguien nos ha mandado una foto desde Aruba y te he visto."
    mc "No, Aaron. That's not my style. Someone not related to NTR sent us a photo from Aruba, and I saw you in it."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:2537
translate english c28s005_GavCall_b5becebb:

    # mc "Para ser más exactos, he descubierto que era Aruba porque tú salías en la foto."
    mc "To be more precise, I discovered it was Aruba because you were in the photo."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:2539
translate english c28s005_GavCall_6ae1d6b4:

    # aar "Disculpa, supongo que es la costumbre de desconfiar de todo el mundo."
    aar "Sorry, I guess it's a habit of mine to distrust everyone."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:2540
translate english c28s005_GavCall_01059510:

    # mc "No te preocupes. No sabía que con quien paseabas fuera Gavin... Únicamente sabía que era un G."
    mc "Don't worry. I didn't know that the person you were walking with was Gavin... I only knew that he was a G."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:2541
