    mc "Although now that I know it's him, I realize that I noticed something strange about his arms... as if he were missing one."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:2543
translate english c28s005_GavCall_d9516baf:

    # aar "Bueno, distinguir a los clones es difícil. *Risa* A veces me cuesta incluso a mí."
    aar "Well, distinguishing clones is difficult. *Laugh* Sometimes even I have trouble."

