    # aar "Supongo que, con el tiempo, acabarás distinguiendo al resto de series. Pero lleva tiempo, especialmente con gente con la que no has tratado mucho."
    aar "I suppose that, over time, you'll end up distinguishing the rest of the series. But it takes time, especially with people you haven't dealt with much."

