translate english c28s005_GavCall_b8032aec:

    # mc "Buenas tardes, Gavin. Llámame [mc]. ¿De qué querías hablar conmigo?"
    mc "Good afternoon, Gavin. Call me [mc]. What did you want to talk to me about?"

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:2556
translate english c28s005_GavCall_a6922e9a:

    # mc "¿Cómo estás del... brazo?"
    mc "How is your... arm?"

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:2558
translate english c28s005_GavCall_7f9add48:

    # gav "El brazo... o la queda de él... va bien, de momento."
    gav "The arm... or what's left of it... is doing well, for now."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:2559
translate english c28s005_GavCall_7cd7f82b:

    # gav "Los médicos me empiezan a dejar hacer vida normal. Esperan que en menos de un mes pueda volver a los entrenamientos."
    gav "The doctors are starting to let me get back to my normal life. They expect that I will be able to return to training in less than a month."

