translate english c28s002_Kat_e9ed4afb:

    # mc "Hola, [kat]."
    mc "Hey, [kat]."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3483
translate english c28s002_Kat_4e495ceb:

    # kat "¡Oh! ¡Hola, [mc]!"
    kat "Oh! Hello, [mc]!"

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3484
translate english c28s002_Kat_fcc93804:

    # mc "¿Qué haces tan sola en la piscina? ¿Esperas a alguien?"
    mc "What are you doing all alone in the pool? Are you waiting for someone?"

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3486
translate english c28s002_Kat_b39f9dd2:

    # kat "No... Había bajado a refrescarme un rato... pero ya me iba..."
    kat "No... I had come down to cool off for a while... but I was leaving..."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3487
translate english c28s002_Kat_fdb950a9:

    # mc "¿Vuelves a esquivarme? No hemos hablado desde la no-cita..."
    mc "Are you avoiding me again? We haven't spoken since the no-date..."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3491
translate english c28s002_Kat_ec721556:

    # kat "No es que te esté esquivándote, es que me siento un poco estúpida y... Bueno, sí. Te estoy esquivando."
    kat "It's not that I'm avoiding you, it's just that I feel a little stupid and... Well, yes. I am avoiding you."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3492
translate english c28s002_Kat_2af831ce:

    # mc "¿Por qué, [kat]? ¿He hecho algo malo?"
    mc "Why, [kat]? Did I do something wrong?"

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3495
translate english c28s002_Kat_561a4531:

    # kat "No, [mc]. Tú no has hecho nada malo. He malinterpretado las señales que me daba a mí misma y no quiero hacerte daño."
    kat "No, [mc]. You didn't do anything wrong. I misinterpreted the signals I was giving myself, and I don't want to hurt you."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3496
translate english c28s002_Kat_6de66e20:

    # mc "¿Hacerme daño? ¿A mí? ¿Por qué?"
    mc "Hurt me? How? Why?"

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3498
translate english c28s002_Kat_0f921d9a:

    # kat "Después de la no-cita... No entendía lo que sentía cuando estaba cerca de ti."
    kat "After the no-date... I didn't understand what I felt when I was around you."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3499
translate english c28s002_Kat_a2bd8322:

    # kat "Por un momento... Por tres o cuatro días, más bien... Incluso antes de la no-cita... He estado dudando de si me estabas empezando a gustar... a nivel romántico."
    kat "For a moment... For three or four days, actually... Even before the no-date... I was wondering if I was starting to like you... romantically."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3500
translate english c28s002_Kat_7071482f:

    # mc "Tal como lo dices, parece que has llegado a la conclusión de que no te gusto a ese nivel."
    mc "As you say it, it sounds like you've come to the conclusion that you don't like me on that level."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3502
translate english c28s002_Kat_699d5915:

    # kat "Exacto. He descubierto que lo que estaba sintiendo es que puedo confiar en ti y estar confortable a tu lado, pero no hay nada romántico."
    kat "Exactly. I've realized that what I was feeling was that I can trust you and feel comfortable around you, but there's nothing romantic about it."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3503
translate english c28s002_Kat_5303454c:

    # kat "No estoy acostumbrada a sentirme así cerca de un tío, y... No sé... Lo estaba confundiendo con otra cosa."
    kat "I'm not used to feeling this way around a guy, and... I don't know... I was confusing it with something else."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3504
translate english c28s002_Kat_5648fd32:

    # mc "Y por eso me estabas esquivando. Necesitabas aclarar tus ideas."
    mc "And that's why you were avoiding me. You needed to get your thoughts straight."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3505
translate english c28s002_Kat_e92e2496:

    # mc "Pero ¿qué tiene que ver eso con hacerme daño?"
    mc "But what does that have to do with hurting me?"

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3507
translate english c28s002_Kat_900b1acb:

    # kat "*Risa* Eres un jodido caballero de la brillante armadura siempre buscando damiselas que salvar."
    kat "*Laugh* You're a bloody knight in shining armor, always looking for damsels to rescue."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3508
translate english c28s002_Kat_2db9ca1c:

    # mc "*Risa* Me lo han dicho alguna vez. Pero sigo sin entender qué tiene que ver eso con hacerme daño."
    mc "*Laugh* I've been told that before. But I still don't understand what that has to do with hurting me."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3510
translate english c28s002_Kat_a8b660ce:

    # kat "Si no te hubiera estado esquivando estos últimos dos días, seguro que hubieras venido en plan caballero salvador."
    kat "If I hadn't been avoiding you for the last two days, I'm sure you would have come to my rescue like a knight in shining armor."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3511
translate english c28s002_Kat_1c273892:

    # kat "Yo, estando confundida como estaba, seguramente hubiera caído en tus brazos sin remedio y..."
    kat "Being as confused as I was, I would surely have fallen into your arms without hesitation and..."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3512
translate english c28s002_Kat_36cd1a51:

    # mc "Y después te hubieras arrepentido. Me hubieras dejado y me hubieras hecho daño."
    mc "And then you would have regretted it. You would have left me and hurt me."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3514
translate english c28s002_Kat_4cf2532a:

    # kat "Exacto. No quería que pasara eso hasta que descubriera qué sentía por ti."
    kat "Exactly. I didn't want that to potentially happen until I figured out how I felt about you."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3515
translate english c28s002_Kat_d83bc490:

    # kat "Si hubiera descubierto que me gustabas a ese nivel, no hubiera habido otro caballero por el que me hubiera gustado más ser salvada."
    kat "If I had realized that I liked you that much, there would have been no other knight I would have been happier to be saved by."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3516
translate english c28s002_Kat_fdf0ee5e:

    # mc "Pero dices que lo has resuelto ya y, pese a todo, me ibas a seguir esquivando. ¿Por qué?"
    mc "But you say you've already figured it out, and yet you were still going to keep avoiding me. Why?"

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3518
translate english c28s002_Kat_51ed7588:

    # kat "Creo que he estado transmitiendo las señales equivocadas. No quería que..."
    kat "I think I've been sending the wrong signals. I didn't want you to..."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3519
translate english c28s002_Kat_5c375ff2:

    # mc "¿Que pensara que te habías enamorado de mí y que mi orgullo masculino se viera herido al descubrir que no lo habías hecho?"
    mc "To think you had fallen in love with me and that my male pride would be hurt when I discovered that you hadn't?"

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3520
translate english c28s002_Kat_79bff2ad:

    # mc "No te preocupes, [kat]."
    mc "Don't worry, [kat]."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3522
translate english c28s002_Kat_6ccbac6e:

    # "*Splash*"
    "*Splash*"

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3524
translate english c28s002_Kat_0c1b889f:

    # kat "¿Qué haces? ¿Por qué te has metido en el agua ahora?"
    kat "What are you doing? Why did you come into the water now?"

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3525
translate english c28s002_Kat_09389333:

    # mc "Porque creo que este puede ser el principio de una gran amistad."
    mc "Because I think this could be the beginning of a beautiful friendship."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3527
translate english c28s002_Kat_a99c1012:

    # mc "¿Amigos?"
    mc "Friends?"

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3528
translate english c28s002_Kat_9da8bdff:

    # kat "Siempre va bien tener un amigo que abraza de puta madre."
    kat "It's always good to have a friend who gives fucking great hugs."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3529
translate english c28s002_Kat_3a86be98:

    # kat "El día que una chica me deje, puedo venir a por un abrazo como este."
    kat "The day a girl dumps me, I can come here for a hug like this."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3530
translate english c28s002_Kat_4277a1dc:

    # mc "*Risa* O el día que una beluga te llame prima."
    mc "*Laugh* Or the day a beluga whale calls you 'cousin'."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3533
translate english c28s002_Kat_b637e84e:

    # kat "No, [mc], no has hecho nada malo, pero no estoy preparada para esto."
    kat "No, [mc], you haven't done anything wrong, but I'm not ready for this."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3534
translate english c28s002_Kat_3438cd03:

    # mc "¿Qué es 'esto'? Si no me lo explicas, no podemos hablarlo. Y si no lo hablamos, no podemos arreglarlo."
    mc "What is 'this'? If you don't explain it to me, we can't talk about it. And if we don't talk about it, we can't sort it out."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3535
translate english c28s002_Kat_f7ae26ea:

    # mc "No quiero que estés evitándome hasta que me vaya a Aruba."
    mc "I don't want you to keep avoiding me before I leave for Aruba."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3536
translate english c28s002_Kat_fca9b049:

    # mc "Si lo quieres hacer, tendré que aceptarlo, pero preferiría que no lo hicieras."
    mc "If you want to do it, I'll have to accept it, but I'd prefer you didn't."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3538
translate english c28s002_Kat_d8d084f0:

    # kat "Es que yo tampoco quiero evitarte, pero no sé cómo enfrentar la situación. Esto es nuevo para mí."
    kat "It's just that I don't want to avoid you either, but I don't know how to deal with this situation. This is new to me."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3539
translate english c28s002_Kat_89fa7b32:

    # kat "O estaba tan enterrado que es como si lo fuera."
    kat "Or it was so buried that it was as if it were."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3540
translate english c28s002_Kat_d5d0f500:

    # mc "Sigues sin decirme que es 'esto'."
    mc "You still haven't told me what 'this' is."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3542
translate english c28s002_Kat_142a7457:

    # kat "No se me da bien hablar de mis sentimientos..."
    kat "I'm not good at talking about my feelings..."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3543
translate english c28s002_Kat_4bffae9c:

    # mc "A nadie se le da bien. Decimos un montón de tonterías y balbuceamos. Hablar de sentimientos es complicado."
    mc "No one is good at it. We say a lot of nonsense, and we babble. Talking about feelings is hard."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3544
translate english c28s002_Kat_dce30889:

    # kat "Y más aún cuando temes hacer el ridículo."
    kat "And even more so when you're afraid of looking foolish."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3545
translate english c28s002_Kat_9c9b78f3:

    # mc "No vas a hacer el ridículo digas lo que digas."
    mc "You won't look foolish, no matter what you say."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3547
translate english c28s002_Kat_0f921d9a_1:

    # kat "Después de la no-cita... No entendía lo que sentía cuando estaba cerca de ti."
    kat "After the no-date... I didn't understand what I felt when I was around you."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3548
translate english c28s002_Kat_a2bd8322_1:

    # kat "Por un momento... Por tres o cuatro días, más bien... Incluso antes de la no-cita... He estado dudando de si me estabas empezando a gustar... a nivel romántico."
    kat "For a moment... For three or four days, actually... Even before the no-date... I was wondering if I was starting to like you... romantically."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3549
translate english c28s002_Kat_7071482f_1:

    # mc "Tal como lo dices, parece que has llegado a la conclusión de que no te gusto a ese nivel."
    mc "As you say it, it sounds like you've concluded that you don't like me on that level."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3551
translate english c28s002_Kat_25560176:

    # kat "He descubierto que lo que estaba sintiendo es que puedo confiar en ti y estar confortable a tu lado..."
    kat "I discovered that what I was feeling was that I can trust you and feel comfortable around you..."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3552
translate english c28s002_Kat_69752053:

    # kat "No estoy acostumbrada a sentirme así cerca de un tío, y... No sé... Creía que lo estaba confundiendo con otra cosa."
    kat "I'm not used to feeling this way around a guy, and... I don't know... I thought I was confusing it with something else."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3553
translate english c28s002_Kat_5648fd32_1:

    # mc "Y por eso me estabas esquivando. Necesitabas aclarar tus ideas."
    mc "And that's why you were avoiding me. You needed to clear your head."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3554
translate english c28s002_Kat_3e2a17ba:

    # mc "Pero podíamos haberlo hablado..."
    mc "But we could have talked about it..."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3556
translate english c28s002_Kat_900b1acb_1:

    # kat "*Risa* Eres un jodido caballero de la brillante armadura siempre buscando damiselas que salvar."
    kat "*Laugh* You're a bloody knight in shining armor, always looking for damsels to rescue."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3557
translate english c28s002_Kat_82e50f83:

    # mc "*Risa* Me lo han dicho alguna vez."
    mc "*Laugh* I've been told that before."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3559
translate english c28s002_Kat_d52a721e:

    # kat "No necesitaba que me salvaran. Necesitaba aclararme."
    kat "I didn't need to be saved. I needed to clear my head."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3560
translate english c28s002_Kat_a8b660ce_1:

    # kat "Si no te hubiera estado esquivando estos últimos dos días, seguro que hubieras venido en plan caballero salvador."
    kat "If I hadn't been avoiding you for the last two days, I'm sure you would have come along like a savior knight."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3561
translate english c28s002_Kat_1c273892_1:

    # kat "Yo, estando confundida como estaba, seguramente hubiera caído en tus brazos sin remedio y..."
    kat "Being as confused as I was, I would surely have fallen into your arms without hesitation and..."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3562
translate english c28s002_Kat_5b8669da:

    # mc "Y después te hubieras arrepentido..."
    mc "And then you would have regretted it..."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3564
translate english c28s002_Kat_2f796d27:

    # kat "¿Has oído hablar del multiverso y los universos paralelos?"
    kat "Have you heard about the multiverse and parallel universes?"

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3565
translate english c28s002_Kat_652a0f09:

    # kat "¿Sabes que, si esa teoría es cierta, hay un universo en el que tenemos esta conversación, pero estamos en un árbol en vez de en una piscina?"
    kat "Do you know that, if that theory is true, there is a universe in which we are having this conversation, but we are on a tree instead of in a pool?"

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3566
translate english c28s002_Kat_cd9c9111:

    # kat "En uno de esos universos, yo soy una ardilla y tú un loro."
    kat "In one of those universes, I am a squirrel and you are a parrot."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3567
translate english c28s002_Kat_4e37e471:

    # "El cambio de tema te pilla un poco a traspiés. Sabes que a [kat] no le gusta hablar de sus sentimientos, pero..."
    "The change of subject catches you a little off guard. You know that [kat] doesn't like to talk about her feelings, but..."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3568
translate english c28s002_Kat_dfb67a9d:

    # mc "Sí, claro que he oído hablar de ello. He leído un montón de cómics sobre eso. Pero ¿a qué viene eso?"
    mc "Yes, of course I've heard of it. I've read a lot of comics about it. But what's that got to do with anything?"

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3570
translate english c28s002_Kat_da923084:

    # kat "Pues que, en algunos de esos universos paralelos, no soy una ardilla, pero tampoco soy una lesbiana idiota que no sabe lo que quiere."
    kat "Well, in some of those parallel universes, I'm not a squirrel, but I'm also not a dorky lesbian who doesn't know what she wants."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3571
translate english c28s002_Kat_bf5909b5:

    # kat "Y, en al menos uno de esos universos, tú me estas besando en este mismo momento."
    kat "And, in at least one of those universes, you are kissing me right now."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3585
translate english c28s002_Kat_6ccbac6e_1:

    # "*Splash*"
    "*Splash*"

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3587
translate english c28s002_Kat_0c1b889f_1:

    # kat "¿Qué haces? ¿Por qué te has metido en el agua ahora?"
    kat "What are you doing? Why did you come into the water now?"

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3588
translate english c28s002_Kat_d53b75e3:

    # mc "Siento mucho que este no sea ese universo, [kat]."
    mc "I'm very sorry that this isn't that universe, [kat]."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3590
translate english c28s002_Kat_d36a0aee:

    # kat "¿Ves? No debería haber hablado de esto contigo. Ahora me siento idiota."
    kat "See? I shouldn't have talked to you about this. Now I feel like an idiot."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3595
translate english c28s002_Kat_4138c944:

    # kat "*Risa* Capullo. Abrázame fuerte y calla."
    kat "*Laugh* Jerk. Hold me tight and shut up."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3597
translate english c28s002_Kat_d8fd6742:

    # kat "Al menos hasta que te tengas que ir a cambiar para la cita con [lis]."
    kat "At least, until you have to go get changed for your date with [lis]."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3600
translate english c28s002_Kat_0da6717f:

    # "Alternáis besos y abrazos hasta que [sam], [nor], y [mar] hacen su aparición en la piscina."
    "You alternate between kisses and hugs until [sam], [nor], and [mar] make their appearance at the pool."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3602
translate english c28s002_Kat_49b771b1:

    # "Continuáis con los abrazos hasta que [sam], [nor], y [mar] hacen su aparición en la piscina."
    "You continue hugging until [sam], [nor], and [mar] make their appearance at the pool."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3603
translate english c28s002_Kat_5018881f:

    # "Os han dejado privacidad para arreglar las cosas, pero ellas también quieren su ración de sol y relax."
    "They have given you privacy to sort things out, but they also want their share of sun and relaxation."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3604
translate english c28s002_Kat_d7138312:

    # "Su llegada marca el momento de dejarlas solas para que [kat] les explique cómo ha ido"
    "Their arrival marks the moment to leave them alone, for [kat] to explain to them how it went."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3606
translate english c28s002_Kat_f325572f:

    # "Vuelves a tu habitación para ducharte y prepararte para ir a buscar a [lis]."
    "You return to your room to shower and get ready to go pick up [lis]."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3608
translate english c28s002_Kat_9ae976fc:

    # "Vuelves a tu habitación y te das una ducha antes de la cena."
    "You return to your room and take a shower before dinner."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3611
translate english c28s002_noKatRoute_f8eea7ed:

    # mc "No debes sentirte idiota. Creo que los dos hemos malinterpretado lo que está pasando."
    mc "You shouldn't feel like an idiot. I think we've both misunderstood what's going on."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3612
translate english c28s002_noKatRoute_ecc5805c:

    # mc "Dices que crees que puedes confiar en mí y estar confortable a mi lado, y que no estás acostumbrada a eso con un tío."
    mc "You say you think you can trust me and feel comfortable around me, and that you're not used to that with a guy."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3614
translate english c28s002_noKatRoute_53a0381d:

    # kat "Es exactamente lo que he dicho..."
    kat "That's exactly what I said..."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3615
translate english c28s002_noKatRoute_493b7130:

    # mc "Pero fíjate que en ningún momento has hablado de que te sientas atraída por mí, o que sientas algo por mí aparte de sentirte a gusto a mi lado."
    mc "But note that at no point have you mentioned feeling attracted to me, or feeling anything for me other than feeling comfortable around me."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3616
translate english c28s002_noKatRoute_ee1d92f6:

    # mc "Esa no es una base para empezar una relación, [kat]. Yo me siento a gusto al lado de Jamaal y confío en él, pero no empezaría una relación con él."
    mc "That's not a basis for starting a relationship, [kat]. I feel comfortable around Jamaal and I trust him, but I wouldn't start a relationship with him."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3618
translate english c28s002_noKatRoute_c9f88420:

    # kat "¿Quieres decir que estoy confundiendo descubrir que eres un buen tío con sentir algo por ti?"
    kat "Are you saying that I'm confusing discovering that you're a good guy with having feelings for you?"

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3619
translate english c28s002_noKatRoute_a6510c01:

    # mc "No soy yo quien tiene que ponerles nombre a tus sentimientos, [kat], pero sé que el tipo aquel en el instituto te hizo daño."
    mc "It's not my place to label your feelings, [kat], but I know that guy in high school hurt you."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3620
translate english c28s002_noKatRoute_2816b3d2:

    # mc "Y que has evitado a los tíos como a la peste desde entonces."
    mc "And you've avoided guys like the plague ever since."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3621
translate english c28s002_noKatRoute_42992cb5:

    # mc "Supongo que descubrir que hay un tío que no te va a hacer daño por nada del mundo puede ser confuso."
    mc "I suppose discovering that there's a guy who won't hurt you for anything in the world can be confusing."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3623
translate english c28s002_noKatRoute_d8ffb4b9:

    # kat "Es posible que tengas razón... Ahora que lo dices... nunca me he imaginado formando una familia contigo..."
    kat "You may be right... Now that you mention it... I've never imagined starting a family with you..."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3624
translate english c28s002_noKatRoute_19019062:

    # mc "Ya hemos formado una familia juntos, [kat]. No es una familia tradicional, pero es una familia."
    mc "We have already started a family together, [kat]. It's not a traditional family, but it's a family."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3625
translate english c28s002_noKatRoute_126d27c6:

    # kat "Quizás necesito más tiempo para analizar lo que siento desde esa nueva perspectiva..."
    kat "Perhaps I need more time to analyze how I feel from this new perspective..."

# game/scripts/c28/c28.rpy:3626
